 if(shipping)content+='<h2>What a shipping quote needs</h2><p>Select the supplier option and quantity, then choose an available origin and enter the destination and postcode. Accurate calculations also depend on the supplier’s weight, volume and logistics properties. Missing product facts must be resolved before interpreting a missing service as a delivery restriction.</p><h2>Taxes and clearance</h2><p>Read the quoted breakdown. Shipping, import taxes, tariffs and clearance handling are different charges. Do not assume that a shipping estimate includes every destination charge. Provide any required tax identification or address detail at checkout, and ask support if a charge or service restriction is unclear.</p><h2>Transit and tracking</h2><p>An estimated transit range is not a guaranteed delivery date. Processing, customs and last-mile handling can affect arrival. Use the tracking details provided for your own order and contact support if tracking does not match the shipment.</p><p><a href="/shipping/">Read the shipping policy</a> · <a href="/shop/">Browse global products</a></p>';
